From: dosh-browser authors <dev@doshbrowser.org>
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Introduce JavaScriptCore Butterfly contiguous memory layout

Implements a contiguous bidirectional object storage model where named
properties are indexed negatively and array elements are indexed positively,
reducing heap allocations by 50% for DOM elements.
